---
import LandingLayout from "../layouts/LandingLayout.astro";
const brandName = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_BRAND_NAME || "Relifish";
---
<LandingLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy · ${brandName}`}
  description={`Privacy policy for ${brandName} — how we handle your data.`}
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-header">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: April 2026</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-body">
      <h2>1. Introduction & Context</h2>
      <p>At {brandName}, we value your trust and are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your personal information when you use our hyperlocal fresh fish marketplace platform.</p>

      <h2>2. What We Collect</h2>
      <p>We only collect the minimum amount of information necessary to connect you with fish sellers near you and fulfill your orders:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Phone Number:</strong> Verified via One-Time Password (OTP) to securely sign you in, prevent spam accounts, and send you critical order status updates.</li>
        <li><strong>Hyperlocal Location:</strong> Captured via browser geolocation (with your permission) or manual input, allowing us to filter and display independent fish sellers operating in your specific neighborhood in Mumbai.</li>
        <li><strong>Saved Addresses:</strong> Stored on your account/device to enable faster checkouts for future deliveries or pickups.</li>
        <li><strong>Order & Transaction History:</strong> Maintained so you can easily browse past purchases, re-order your favorite species, and resolve any disputes with sellers.</li>
        <li><strong>Profile Information (Optional):</strong> Your email address and name, only if you choose to provide them to personalize your profile.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To verify your identity and secure your account access via SMS OTP.</li>
        <li>To connect you with nearby fish sellers and enable hyperlocal menu displays.</li>
        <li>To process and transmit your orders directly to the chosen independent sellers.</li>
        <li>To send you transactional notifications (order confirmations, preparation updates, pickup availability, and WhatsApp order summaries).</li>
        <li>To send you marketing updates or waitlist announcements, strictly with your opt-in consent.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Data Sharing & Disclosure</h2>
      <p>We believe in absolute transparency. Your trust is our biggest asset:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>With Sellers:</strong> We share your name, phone number, and delivery/pickup address with the specific seller you order from so they can prepare, custom-cut, and fulfill your order.</li>
        <li><strong>No Selling of Data:</strong> We do not sell, trade, rent, or monetize your personal data or phone number to any third-party marketing companies.</li>
        <li><strong>No Cross-App Tracking:</strong> We do not track your browsing activity across other apps or websites.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We implement industry-standard administrative, technical, and physical security measures to protect your phone number, order history, and address details. All online payments are securely processed through our authorized payment gateway partner (Razorpay). {brandName} does not directly collect, process, or store your credit card details or bank account numbers on our servers.</p>

      <h2>6. Your Rights & Data Deletion</h2>
      <p>Under applicable data protection laws, you have full control over your personal data. You have the right to access, correct, or delete your information at any time.</p>
      <p>To request the permanent deletion of your account and associated personal data, simply email us at <a href="mailto:relifishstore@gmail.com">relifishstore@gmail.com</a>. We will process your request and purge your data within 30 days, subject to any legally mandated record-retention requirements.</p>

      <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in our practices or legal obligations. We will notify you of any material changes by updating the "Last updated" date at the top of this page.</p>

      <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>{brandName} · Mumbai, India · <a href="mailto:relifishstore@gmail.com">relifishstore@gmail.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</LandingLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 56px 24px 80px;
  }
  .legal-header {
    border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .legal-header h1 {
    font: 900 36px/1.2 Inter, sans-serif;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .legal-updated {
    font: 400 13px Inter, sans-serif;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .legal-body {
    font: 400 15px/1.7 Inter, sans-serif;
    color: #334155;
  }
  .legal-body h2 {
    font: 700 18px Inter, sans-serif;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin: 36px 0 12px;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
  }
  .legal-body p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .legal-body ul {
    padding-left: 22px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .legal-body li { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .legal-body a { color: #0066ff; font-weight: 500; }
  .legal-body strong { color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .legal-page { padding: 36px 16px 60px; }
    .legal-header h1 { font-size: 28px; }
  }
</style>
